      "title": "The Hollow Herd",
      "status": "released",
      "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZ3uWHmWOPCY",
      "description": "\"Where\u2019s the Beef?\" It used to be a funny commercial slogan. Now, it is a haunting economic question.\nThe Hollow Herd is a forensic sonic audit of the American cattle crisis. It traces the deliberate destruction of the independent rancher through the mechanisms of financialization, monopolization, and environmental extraction. We are witnessing the \"hollowing out\" of an American way of life\u2014where the cattle inventory has dropped to its lowest levels since 1951, yet the corporate profits of the \"Big Four\" meatpackers have never been higher.\nThis album is not just a collection of songs; it is a narrative arc that moves from the muddy reality of the calving barn to the sterile corruption of the commodities trading floor. It exposes the \"Hourglass Economy,\" where millions of producers and millions of consumers are squeezed by a tiny oligopoly that controls the middle. It uncovers the \"Paper Cattle\" fraud, where Wall Street trades phantom herds that don't exist, while real ranchers go bankrupt trying to raise living animals. And it confronts the environmental reality of \"Buy and Dry,\" where our water is sold off to thirsty cities, leaving the plains to return to dust.\nBut amidst the betrayal of the \"Checkoff\" tax and the \"Product of USA\" labeling loopholes, The Hollow Herd finds a path to resilience. It champions the Prime Act and the return to local food sovereignty, arguing that the only way to save the herd is to break the trust and return to the land.\nThis is a story about the difference between price and value. The price of beef is high, but the value of the rural community is being set to zero. Join The Shady River Bard for a journey into the heart of the American food system, where we ask not just \"Where is the beef?\" but \"Where is the justice?\"\n#TheHollowHerd #CattleCrisis #TheShadyRiverBard #FoodSovereignty #Americana #Storytelling",
